WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.907
Watch and read: For your characters practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:04.907 --> 00:00:09.614
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:09.614 --> 00:00:09.928
character?

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:14.901
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:20.470
Watch and read: For your retell practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:25.156
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:25.156 --> 00:00:25.469
character?

00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:30.401
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.
